{"title":"Career roadmap · Product Analyst","role":"Product Analyst","summary":"A Product Analyst uses product data, customer behaviour, experimentation and business analysis to help product teams decide what to build, why to build it and how to improve product performance.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM","Course":"BBA – FinTech"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a BBA – FinTech graduate, this is a strong direct alignment, particularly for banking, payments, lending, insurance, wealth-tech and other financial-product companies."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA FinTech","Product/Business Analytics Internship","Product Analyst Intern / Junior Analyst","Product Analyst","Senior Product Analyst","Product Analytics Lead","Product Manager / Senior Product Manager / Head of Product Analytics"]},{"type":"h","text":"Career facts"},{"type":"table","header":["Item","Details"],"rows":[[{"text":"Starts"},{"text":"Year 1"}],[{"text":"Current degree"},{"text":"BBA / BMS / BBM"}],[{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"FinTech"}],[{"text":"Desired career"},{"text":"Product Analyst"}],[{"text":"Career cluster"},{"text":"Product Management · Data Analytics · FinTech"}],[{"text":"Alignment"},{"text":"Strong direct alignment"}],[{"text":"Best domains"},{"text":"Payments · Banking · Lending · WealthTech · InsurTech · RegTech"}]]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build SQL, statistics, product analytics, FinTech and business fundamentals. Complete 2–3 internships and 5–6 product analytics projects."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Become a strong Product Analyst and specialise in payments, lending, banking, wealth or another FinTech product domain."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Senior Product Analyst, Product Analytics Le